ncies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Summary\r\n`st.altair_chart` should maintain the aspect ratio when maximized.\r\n\r\n# Steps to reproduce\r\n```\r\nimport streamlit as st\r\nimport numpy as np\r\nimport pandas as pd\r\nimport altair as alt\r\n\r\ndf = pd.DataFrame(np.random.randn(200, 3), columns=[\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"])\r\n\r\nc = alt.Chart(df).mark_circle().encode(x=\"a\", y=\"b\", size=\"c\", color=\"c\")\r\n\r\nst.altair_chart(c, width=-1)\r\n```\r\n\r\nOpen the UI and click on the maximize button\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior:\r\nIt should display a square chart\r\n\r\n## Actual behavior:\r\nIt displays a tall and narrow chart.\r\nBefore maximizing:\r\n<img width=\"1680\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2019-10-28 at 11 29 13 AM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6821233/67708752-ec294f00-f979-11e9-8ac6-0555b7627849.png\">\r\nAfter Maximizing:\r\n<img width=\"1662\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2019-10-28 at 11 55 32 AM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6821233/67708764-f0ee0300-f979-11e9-8330-cf772516fccb.png\">\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n## Is this a regression?\r\nNot sure. It may be.\r\n\r\n# Debug info\r\n- Streamlit version: ad5f3885dda3f1920d82f921ecdee39320910c60\r\n- Python version: (get it with `$ python --version`)\r\n- Using Conda? PipEnv? PyEnv? Pex?\r\n- OS version:\r\n- Browser version:\r\n\r\n# Additional information\r\nUnsure the width=-1 behavior is the expected one from start.\r\n\r\nhttps://discuss.streamlit.io/t/something-not-working-with-altair-chart-height-past-v0-47-4/720/6\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"arraydude","id":631997,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMTk5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/631997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arraydude","html_url":"https://github.com/arraydude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arraydude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arraydude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"htt